### Minimal API to drive the engine

```go
cfg := NewCFG()
// ... create blocks, set cfg.Entry, append Def/Use ops, AddEdge ...
e := NewEngine(cfg)

cfg.RemoveEdge(b, h)
cfg.AddEdge(b, h2)
cfg.AddEdge(h2, b2)
cfg.AddEdge(b2, h2)
cfg.AddEdge(h2, exit)

e.Update()

if errs := Verify(cfg, e.SSA(), true); len(errs) != 0 {
    panic(errs)
}
```

